# Where logged-in visitors to the marketing homepage are redirected (read by
# proxy.ts). During the POC, set this to the app URL you want to land on — e.g.
# the Bubble version-test URL. At real migration, set it to the production app:
# https://app.gatherwise.io/dashboard
#
# NOTE: also set this in the Vercel project's Environment Variables so the
# deployed preview (preview.gatherwise.io) uses it.
APP_REDIRECT_URL=https://app.gatherwise.io/dashboard
